    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-50">Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Research use only</h2>
      <p>
        All products sold by PeptideLab are intended for laboratory research use only. They are not
        intended for human or veterinary consumption, and are not approved by any regulatory authority
        for the diagnosis, treatment, cure or prevention of any disease.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">No medical advice</h2>
      <p>
        The information on this website is provided for general informational purposes only and does not
        constitute medical, legal or professional advice. You should always consult a qualified
        professional for advice specific to your circumstances.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Age restriction</h2>
      <p>
        This website is intended for adults aged 18 and over. By accessing this site you confirm that
        you are at least 18 years of age.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">No liability</h2>
